        "description": "For BTC-USD, the mean t+1 return when the day close-normalized intraday range (high_t - low_t)/close_t exceeds its trailing 20-day average exceeds the mean t+1 return otherwise -- INTRADAY_RANGE, a volatility-expansion signal reading high/low for the first time (never touched by any prior Strategy).",
